# The handler of "CUDA" of mdir.jax (D373), scenario
# sanitize of Driver/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py, under compute-sanitizer:
# the copies of a call between XLA's buffers on the device and the host on
# XLA's stream, the evaluation of the frames by a program of the GPU, and a
# frame that fails, with no access beyond a buffer.
#
# REQUIRES: cuda, compute-sanitizer, python-api, jax
#
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %compute_sanitizer --tool memcheck --error-exitcode 1 %jax_python \
# RUN:   %S/../Driver/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/../Driver/Inputs/dipeptide sanitize Double GPU 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: GPU Double: sanitize: energies, gradients, the program's cell, new values of params, a frame that fails, and the same energies after it: True
# CHECK: jax passed
# CHECK: ERROR SUMMARY: 0 errors
